{"page":59,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:71","surah":3,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ لِمَ تَلْبِسُونَ ٱلْحَقَّ بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ وَتَكْتُمُونَ ٱلْحَقَّ وَأَنتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"People of the Book, why do you mix truth with falsehood? Why do you hide the truth when you recognize it?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","en_gloss":"O People","transliteration":"yāahla","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِمَ","en_gloss":"Why","transliteration":"lima","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَلْبِسُونَ","en_gloss":"do you mix","transliteration":"talbisūna","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْحَقَّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ","en_gloss":"with the falsehood","transliteration":"bil-bāṭili","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَتَكْتُمُونَ","en_gloss":"and conceal","transliteration":"wataktumūna","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْحَقَّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"while you","transliteration":"wa-antum","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"3:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٧١","en_gloss":"(71)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:71"}]},{"verse_key":"3:72","surah":3,"ayah":72,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَت طَّآئِفَةٌ مِّنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ءَامِنُوا۟ بِٱلَّذِىٓ أُنزِلَ عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَجْهَ ٱلنَّهَارِ وَٱكْفُرُوٓا۟ ءَاخِرَهُۥ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَرْجِعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Some of the People of the Book say, ‘At the beginning of the day, believe in what has been revealed to these believers [the Muslims], then at the end of the day reject it, so that they too may turn back,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَت","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqālat","verse_key":"3:72"},{"pos":2,"ar":"طَّآئِفَةٌۭ","en_gl