ss he follows your own religion’- [Prophet], tell them, ‘True guidance is the guidance of God’- [they say], ‘Do not believe that anyone else could be given a revelation similar to what you were given, or that they could use it to argue against you in your Lord’s presence.’ [Prophet], tell them, ‘All grace is in God’s hands: He grants it to whoever He will- He is all embracing, all knowing-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُؤْمِنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"tu'minū","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِمَن","en_gloss":"(the one) who","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَبِعَ","en_gloss":"follows","transliteration":"tabiʿa","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":6,"ar":"دِينَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your religion","transliteration":"dīnakum","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","en_gloss":"the (true) guidance","transliteration":"l-hudā","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هُدَى","en_gloss":"(is the) Guidance","transliteration":"hudā","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah ","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يُؤْتَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"is given","transliteration":"yu'tā","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَحَدٌۭ","en_gloss":"(to) one ","transliteration":"aḥadun","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّثْلَ","en_gloss":"(the) like","transliteration":"mith'la","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:73"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أُوتِيتُمْ","en_gloss":"was given to you","transliteration":"ūtītum","verse_key":"3:73"